      "Account for the tree header, optional time-of-day palette, recursive draw-node hierarchy,
and prototype array.")
    (login :override-doc "Log in the tree's prototype array when it is present.")
    (draw :override-doc
      "Queue this shrub tree and its owning level for the background pass; root and frame are
provided by the drawable interface but are not needed.")
