  "Reinitialize the fields specified by launcher on a live particle, preserving unspecified values
and the particle's level flags. Time-of-day-colored particles preserve or retint each RGB and fade
component according to whether the new launcher supplies that component."
  (function object sparticle-launcher sparticle-cpuinfo sprite-vec-data-3d none))

(define-extern sp-init-fields!
  "Walk sorted 16-byte init specs and initialize consecutive fields in the half-open ID range
