the next unconsumed spec so callers can process adjacent field ranges without restarting."
  (function (pointer float) (inline-array sp-field-init-spec) sp-field-id sp-field-id symbol (inline-array sp-field-init-spec)))

(define-extern sp-launch-particles-var
  "Birth rate-scaled particles from launcher at pos. Decode the launcher's misc, sprite, CPU, and
launch fields; allocate each particle; apply local, cone, Euler, and owning-system rotations; build
