 direction opposite local-down while preserving its forward axis." (function matrix vector matrix))
(define-extern parameter-ease-sin-clamp "Clamp t to 0..1 and apply a half-cosine ease with zero
 slope at both endpoints." (function float float))
(define-extern cam-slave-get-intro-step "Read intro-time plus intro-time-offset and return the
 normalized increment for one 60 Hz frame. A non-positive duration uses the 1/240 fallback."
  (function entity float))
